3. Farewell patterns are an unreliable way to recognize whether the player wants to end the session. The agent should recognize if the player wants to do so and say some conventional greeting, eg "Menj, ha menned kell!". This should end the session.
4. Milestones should progress each day as we assume that players will complete one milestone per day. It should still be manually edit-able per spirit. Milestone secrets should not go into the dynamic prompts but should be appended to the end of the spirit system prompt at the start of each new day. It would be better if milestones required no greeting, only extra context. Having no milestone for the day should not break the system.
5. We would like to play preset music/ambience for summoning, recording, speaking and end of session.

